><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ITOH, MOTOHIKO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IWAGUCHI, ISAO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWAI, HIROAKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WATANABE, MITSUO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ITOH MOTOHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IWAGUCHI ISAO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAWAI HIROAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>WATANABE MITSUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ITOH, MOTOHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IWAGUCHI, ISAO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWAI, HIROAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WATANABE, MITSUO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A bar width correcting device comprising a reference bar width calculating section for calculating reference bar widths used as references of bar width, an average value calculating section for calculating an average value of the reference bar widths calculated, an error calculating section for calculating the errors between the bar widths of bars to be corrected and the reference bar widths, and a correcting section for correcting the bar width of a bar to be corrected using the average reference bar width if the error is equal to or above a predetermined value and correcting the bar width using the reference bar width if the error is below the predetermined value, wherein even if the bar widths of the bar code are irregularly thick or thin, the bar widths are appropriately corrected so as to prevent misread of a bar code.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif de correction de la largeur de barre comprenant une section de calcul des largeurs de barre de référence utilisées comme référence des largeurs de barre, une section de calcul de la valeur moyenne des largeurs de barre de référence calculées, une section de calcul des erreurs intercalées entre les largeurs de barres devant être corrigées et les largeurs de barre de référence, enfin une section de correction de la largeur d'une barre devant être corrigée au moyen de la largeur de barre de référence si l'erreur se situe en-dessous de la valeur prédéterminée. Même si les largeurs de barre du code à barres sont irrégulièrement épaisses ou minces, elles sont corrigées comme il convient, de façon à empêcher une erreur de lecture d'un code à barres.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>